---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Rosternado — Delete Account"
  description="How to delete your Rosternado account and what data is removed."
>
  <div class="wrap wrap--narrow legal">
    <header class="page-head">
        <h1>Delete Account</h1>
      </header>
    
      <div class="card card--text danger-card">
        <h2>Delete your account</h2>
        <p>Sorry to see you go. Deleting your account permanently removes the following data:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your <strong>profile</strong> (name, email, profile picture).</li>
          <li>All uploaded <strong>roster and schedule</strong> data.</li>
          <li>Your <strong>friend connections</strong> and sharing permissions.</li>
          <li>Push <strong>notification tokens</strong> tied to your device.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    
      <div class="card card--text">
        <h2>Option 1 &mdash; Delete in the app (recommended)</h2>
        <p>The fastest way to remove your data is from inside Rosternado:</p>
        <ol>
          <li>Open the <strong>Rosternado</strong> app.</li>
          <li>Go to your <strong>Profile</strong>.</li>
          <li>Scroll to <strong>Delete Account</strong>.</li>
          <li>Tap it and <strong>confirm</strong>.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    
      <div class="card card--text">
        <h2>Option 2 &mdash; Request by email</h2>
        <p>Already uninstalled the app? Email us from the address linked to your account and we'll process the deletion.
        </p>
        <a class="btn" href="mailto:info@rosternado.com?subject=Rosternado%20Account%20Deletion%20Request">Request
          deletion via email</a>
      </div>
    
      <div class="card card--text">
        <h2>Data retention</h2>
        <p>Once processed, your personal data (profile, roster, friendships and related records) is permanently removed
          from our Supabase databases. Subscription billing history held by the App Store / Google Play and RevenueCat may
          be retained for accounting and legal compliance as required by law.</p>
        <p>To prevent abuse of one-time free benefits (such as the free roster upload) by repeatedly deleting and
          recreating accounts, we retain a <strong>one-way, irreversible hash</strong> of your email address and social
          sign-in identifier. This value cannot be reversed to recover your email or identify you, and is kept solely for
          fraud prevention on the basis of our legitimate interest.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
